Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: capture a 10-bit frame for screenshots

The SDR screenshot tonemap is fed the 8-bit NV12 capture, which bands
HDR gradients and speckles Dolby Vision highlights, while vdin1 can give
VD1 as 10-bit 4:2:2.
